  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 320" role="img" aria-labelledby="cvr-t cvr-d" class="fig-light" style="background:#fff">
    <title id="cvr-t">Straight line distance compared with a road route</title>
    <desc id="cvr-d">Two towns on opposite sides of a lake. The straight line crosses the water. The road has to go around the shore and over a bridge, so it is longer.</desc>
